This directory is a TypeScript port of Shortest Path, a RuneLite plugin hub plugin by Skretzo and
contributors: https://github.com/Skretzo/shortest-path, release v1.22.5
(commit 142e73e2a5f840bb16e227e564a036156f4cfc77). Its transport TSVs and item-variations.tsv are
copied unchanged into client/public/shortestpath/. It is distributed under the BSD 2-Clause
licence below, as upstream's LICENSE file gives it.

server/scripts/export-collision-map.cjs keeps the door exclusions and the door and floor rules of
CollisionMapDumper.java from https://github.com/osrs-pathfinding/shortest-path-tooling
(commit 92bf3c26ee3d21cb7ecbca69ba8420a6ae146a61), Copyright (c) 2016-2017, Adam
<Adam@sigterm.info> and Copyright (c) 2022, Skretzo <https://github.com/Skretzo>, under the same
BSD 2-Clause licence.

quests.ts is RuneLite's Quest enum (runelite-parent-1.13.3), Copyright (c) 2019 Abex, under the
same BSD 2-Clause licence.

